Recommends: xwayland, mesa-utils, hicolor-icon-theme, fonts-dejavu-core
Description: Spanda system health dashboard
 Spanda is a polished desktop dashboard for live CPU, memory, disk, network,
 GPU and process monitoring, with grouped process rows and a detailed hardware
 Specs view. The package includes a native launcher and desktop integration
 for Kubuntu/Plasma and other X11 or XWayland sessions.
